<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-4-12"><div class="block block-quote"><div class="has-icon left block-quote-figure"><div class="block-quote-image"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square shape-circle"><img alt="Eliška Škubalová" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="/files/r/1280/eliska-skubalova.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/eliska-skubalova.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/eliska-skubalova.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/eliska-skubalova.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><i class="icon icon-quote-right"></i><blockquote class="block-quote-text">Protel v našom hoteli využívame už veľa rokov a za tú dobu nám bol vždy oporou v každodennom fungovaní hotela. Veľmi spoľahlivá podpora je veľkým bonusom.</blockquote><div class="block-quote-author"><span class="quote-decor">–</span> GRAND HOTEL BOHEMIA <span class="quote-decor">–</span><span class="block-quote-info">Eliška Škubalová</span></div></div></div></div> <div class="col col-5-12 grid-4-12"><div class="block block-quote"><div class="has-icon left block-quote-figure"><div class="block-quote-image"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square shape-circle"><img alt="Marián Madara" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="/files/r/1280/marian-madara.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/marian-madara.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/marian-madara.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/marian-madara.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><i class="icon icon-quote-right"></i><blockquote class="block-quote-text">Podiel priameho online predaja neustále zvyšujeme aj vďaka možnostiam dynamickej cenotvorby a prepojenia s CRM, ktoré systém protel umožňuje.</blockquote><div class="block-quote-author"><span class="quote-decor">–</span> TMR Hotels <span class="quote-decor">–</span><span class="block-quote-info">Marián Madara</span></div></div></div></div> <div class="col col-9-12 grid-4-12"><div class="block block-quote"><div class="has-icon left block-quote-figure"><div class="block-quote-image"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square shape-circle"><img alt="Ivona Meissner" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="/files/r/1280/ivona-meissner.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/ivona-meissner.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/ivona-meissner.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/ivona-meissner.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><i class="icon icon-quote-right"></i><blockquote class="block-quote-text">Ďakujem firme Protel za profesionálny support a inštaláciu!</blockquote><div class="block-quote-author"><span class="quote-decor">–</span> BWH Hotel Group <span class="quote-decor">–</span><span class="block-quote-info">Ivona Meissner</span></div></div></div></div></div>
